{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23813","headline":"六年秋重题白莲 · 白居易","name":"六年秋重题白莲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"素房含露玉冠鲜，绀叶摇风钿扇圆。\n本是吴州供进藕，今爲伊水寄生莲。\n移根到此三千里，结子经今六七年。\n不独池中花故旧，兼乘旧日采花船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23813.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23813","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}